<import src="../../templates/shared.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><template wx:if="{{!vehicle && !error}}" is="onboarding"/><block wx:if="{{vehicle}}"><template is="vehicle-switch" data="{{vehicle,vehicles,vehicleIndex}}"/><view class="title">花在哪里，一目了然</view><picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{month}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="monthChange"><view class="picker">{{month}} 月度费用 ▾</view></picker><view class="card spaced"><view class="muted">本月已记支出</view><view class="amount">¥{{amount}}</view><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="kind"><view class="plan-title"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view></view><view class="section"><text class="section-title">历史完整区间能耗</text></view><view class="tiny">以下按全部历史完整区间加权统计，不随上方月份筛选。</view><view class="card spaced" wx:for="{{energy}}" wx:key="name"><view class="muted">{{item.name}}</view><view class="metric">{{item.result.rate || '—'}}<text class="unit">{{item.unit}}</text></view><view class="tiny" wx:if="{{item.result.rate}}">{{item.result.intervals.length}} 个有效区间 · {{item.result.km}} km</view><view class="tiny" wx:else>尚无完整、可比较的记录区间</view></view><view class="notice">油耗采用满箱法；充电侧电耗只使用充电后电量相同、且用户确认记录完整的区间，可能包含充电损耗。插混的油量与电量均按各自区间总里程计算，不代表纯油或纯电模式能耗，也不能相加。</view></block></view>
